<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CulTel declares final dividend.</title>
<headline>CulTel declares final dividend.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African hotels firm Cullinan Hotels and Leisure Group Ltd on Friday declared a final dividend for the year ended December 31 of 3.25 cents.</p>
<p>It said the final dividend would be paid to shareholders registered on December 27 and paid on February 7.</p>
<p>The group also said its unconditional cash offer of 100 cents a share to minorities was accepted by shareholders holding 2,153 ordinary shares.</p>
<p>The clawback offer shares which could be subscribed for were 96.6 percent subscribed.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
